  (text "J3 -> WL-125 RFID (1x10 socket, 2.54mm)\n1,2: ANT - coil soldered on module, ~100Vpp, NC here\n3: ASCII select = VCC_RF (UART mode)\n4: BEEP (NC)\n5: TX 9600 8N1, 5V -> Q1 level shifter -> RFID_TX 3.0V\n6: Wiegand D0 (NC)\n7: /RESET (R7 pull-up)\n8: GND\n9: VCC_RF (5V, RC filtered)\n10: key, NC" (at 213.36 106.68 0)
